WEBVTT

00:59.000 --> 00:59.800
Report!

01:02.080 --> 01:04.040
General, the Empress Dowager is missing.

01:04.040 --> 01:05.120
What?

01:19.200 --> 01:20.480
The camp is crude.

01:21.000 --> 01:24.320
I cannot bear to see the Empress Dowager suffer.

01:24.320 --> 01:28.039
So I took her to stay with the Helian clan for a few days.

01:28.160 --> 01:29.680
When the Great General returns,

01:29.680 --> 01:31.039
she will be sent back immediately.

01:31.039 --> 01:33.720
Helian Jie has abducted the Empress Dowager.

01:34.360 --> 01:37.200
Men, assemble the troops and head to the Helian clan immediately.

01:37.200 --> 01:38.000
Wait.

01:38.720 --> 01:40.960
Young General, what do you mean?

01:40.960 --> 01:42.280
You guard this place.

01:42.280 --> 01:44.120
Leave this matter to me.

01:47.600 --> 01:49.060
Thank you, Young General.

01:54.280 --> 01:55.080
General,

01:55.479 --> 01:57.210
are we just going to let this go?

01:57.920 --> 01:58.979
It doesn't matter.

02:00.000 --> 02:03.040
The gold vein is the most important thing.

02:03.040 --> 02:04.520
There can be no mistakes.

02:05.000 --> 02:06.680
Otherwise, if the Great General blames us,

02:06.680 --> 02:08.080
I won't be able to bear it.

02:08.320 --> 02:09.440
Besides,

02:09.440 --> 02:11.680
we met the Empress Dowager by accident,

02:11.680 --> 02:13.880
and now she's been taken away by Helian Jie.

02:13.880 --> 02:15.940
Even if trouble arises in the future,

02:16.680 --> 02:18.640
it has nothing to do with me.

02:20.000 --> 02:20.560
Understood.

02:20.560 --> 02:21.090
Let's go.

02:35.079 --> 02:35.440
Young Master.

02:35.440 --> 02:36.700
Where is Her Ladyship?

02:36.720 --> 02:37.650
Where is she now?

02:37.880 --> 02:39.160
Aren't you quite good at predicting things?

02:39.160 --> 02:40.890
Do you still need me to tell you?

02:41.120 --> 02:42.120
Return to Wuse City.

02:42.120 --> 02:44.480
Why are you suddenly in a rush to return to Wuse City?

02:44.480 --> 02:46.640
A'man secretly kidnapped Ji Mingyue.

02:47.120 --> 02:49.400
The Helian Clan has long been oppressed by the imperial court.

02:49.400 --> 02:50.800
Every year on the Empress Dowager's birthday,

02:50.800 --> 02:53.120
the court would take the opportunity to demand an additional 50,000 taels of gold as tribute.

02:53.120 --> 02:55.800
The entire Helian Clan has hated her to the bone for a long time.

02:55.800 --> 02:57.600
If she is brought to the Helian Clan now,

02:57.600 --> 02:59.240
not only will she be in danger,

02:59.240 --> 03:02.040
but the Helian Clan will also be pushed to the forefront of the storm.

03:02.040 --> 03:03.280
A'man's action

03:03.280 --> 03:04.920
undoubtedly adds fuel to the fire.

03:04.920 --> 03:05.720
A'man

03:06.280 --> 03:07.200
is too willful.

03:11.600 --> 03:13.000
Are you going to find her?

03:13.200 --> 03:13.880
Of course.

03:35.040 --> 03:36.500
Greetings, young master.

03:46.480 --> 03:47.800
Empress Dowager.

03:48.400 --> 03:49.860
Don't look at me like that.

03:51.160 --> 03:53.480
I just used a little trick

03:53.800 --> 03:55.640
so you can't use your magic.

03:57.600 --> 03:59.440
Without your magic

04:00.920 --> 04:02.920
and the unique acupoint sealing technique

04:02.920 --> 04:04.920
of our Helian clan,

04:05.680 --> 04:06.840
you

04:07.600 --> 04:09.080
can't undo it.

04:15.160 --> 04:17.760
Young Master, they are...

04:19.079 --> 04:21.959
The Demon Empress, Ji Mingyue.

04:22.240 --> 04:23.360
What?

04:25.480 --> 04:26.520
Take them inside.

04:26.920 --> 04:27.520
Yes, sir.

04:30.800 --> 04:31.440
Move!

04:34.080 --> 04:34.720
Move!

04:37.240 --> 04:37.880
Hurry up!

04:39.920 --> 04:40.600
Young Master.

04:40.600 --> 04:43.480
The letter you told me to send to General Shen in the capital

04:43.480 --> 04:44.680
has been delivered.

04:45.240 --> 04:46.040
Good.

04:46.880 --> 04:48.520
Shen Lian is coming too.

04:48.720 --> 04:50.440
Then Wuse City

04:50.760 --> 04:53.400
will have its liveliest day in history.

04:56.920 --> 04:58.360
Shen Lian is coming.

04:58.360 --> 05:00.280
Does the High Priest know?

05:04.960 --> 05:06.420
My father is in seclusion.

05:06.800 --> 05:08.130
He doesn't need to know.

05:09.320 --> 05:11.680
That bitch used my father for years.

05:12.560 --> 05:14.480
It's time for her to pay.

05:14.480 --> 05:15.400
Shen Lian.

05:15.400 --> 05:17.000
The Emperor has his eyes on her.

05:17.000 --> 05:19.280
I'm afraid she won't be able to leave the city.

05:19.280 --> 05:20.840
You underestimate her.

05:21.480 --> 05:22.600
She is formidable.

05:23.480 --> 05:25.880
She values wealth and power above all.

05:26.920 --> 05:27.720
Tell me,

05:28.320 --> 05:32.180
if she hears Baili Jinghong was secretly assassinated by my brother,

05:32.400 --> 05:34.720
that several gold veins are now ownerless,

05:34.720 --> 05:36.240
and that she is desperately needed

05:36.240 --> 05:38.240
to take charge,

05:41.680 --> 05:43.159
could she resist coming?

05:44.520 --> 05:45.120
Give me back my son!

05:45.120 --> 05:46.360
Demon Empress!

05:46.360 --> 05:47.420
Give me back my son!

05:47.680 --> 05:49.720
Demon Empress!

05:51.159 --> 05:52.020
Demon Empress,

05:52.520 --> 05:53.850
you ruined our country!

05:58.680 --> 05:59.740
Give me back my son!

06:00.920 --> 06:01.780
Demon Empress,

06:02.240 --> 06:03.680
go to hell!

06:04.120 --> 06:04.960
Go to hell!

06:04.960 --> 06:05.820
Demon Empress,

06:06.680 --> 06:07.960
you ruined our country!

06:07.960 --> 06:09.090
It's all your fault!

06:09.880 --> 06:10.740
Demon Empress!

06:12.760 --> 06:14.080
How dare you harm us!

06:14.080 --> 06:15.440
Why don't you just die?

06:15.440 --> 06:16.300
Demon Empress,

06:16.480 --> 06:17.480
beat her to death!

06:19.280 --> 06:20.810
The corruption of a dynasty

06:21.240 --> 06:23.520
always uses women as scapegoats.

06:24.000 --> 06:25.640
A hundred years from now,

06:25.640 --> 06:27.280
will history books also claim

06:27.280 --> 06:30.440
that I am the demon empress who ruined the Dayin court?

06:32.360 --> 06:33.760
It's ridiculous. Why?

06:34.600 --> 06:37.200
Why does history only blame women for ruining the country,

06:37.200 --> 06:40.000
but never records their merits and achievements?

06:40.640 --> 06:42.720
Why are women merely tools to bear shame

06:42.720 --> 06:44.280
and infamous reputations?

06:46.280 --> 06:48.540
It is only because, since ancient times,

06:48.600 --> 06:51.320
no woman has ever sat on the supreme throne.

06:53.240 --> 06:55.800
Therefore, the snobbish masses

06:56.320 --> 06:58.040
never speak up for them.

07:00.000 --> 07:01.200
How do you have the nerve to live?

07:01.200 --> 07:02.360
Demon Empress!

07:03.160 --> 07:04.120
You monster!

07:04.440 --> 07:05.320
Die!

07:06.960 --> 07:09.090
How do you still have the nerve to live?

07:11.920 --> 07:13.760
Just die, Demon Empress!

07:13.960 --> 07:16.690
The eldest young master has returned to the city!

07:16.880 --> 07:19.610
The eldest young master has returned to the city!

07:21.960 --> 07:23.760
The eldest young master is back!

07:23.760 --> 07:25.560
Eldest young master!

07:27.240 --> 07:30.840
Go, bathe Her Grace and change her clothes.

07:30.840 --> 07:31.640
Yes.

07:36.240 --> 07:37.100
Your Highness.

07:37.560 --> 07:40.760
Please don't blame me for sealing your acupoints again.

07:41.400 --> 07:43.040
Your methods are too formidable.

07:43.040 --> 07:44.400
I was forced to do this.

07:44.680 --> 07:46.480
I have no choice but to wrong you.

07:48.320 --> 07:50.200
Your Highness, are you satisfied with this one?

07:50.200 --> 07:51.640
Change the pearl hairpin.

07:51.640 --> 07:52.840
This one is too tacky.

07:53.280 --> 07:54.720
Brother won't like it.

07:54.720 --> 07:55.280
Yes.

08:00.400 --> 08:01.800
Then how about this one?

08:10.720 --> 08:12.080
Dressed up like this,

08:12.840 --> 08:14.880
Your Highness is truly stunning.

08:15.240 --> 08:18.160
Don't worry. I have no interest in you.

08:28.400 --> 08:30.040
Aman is of great importance.

08:30.320 --> 08:32.450
Where exactly is the Empress Dowager?

08:32.480 --> 08:34.000
Don't rush, brother.

08:34.559 --> 08:35.840
Get some rest.

08:35.880 --> 08:37.080
You will see her soon.

08:47.280 --> 08:49.640
There have been many coincidences on this journey.

08:49.640 --> 08:50.570
What is going on?

08:54.160 --> 08:56.040
Mother, why are you here?

08:56.360 --> 08:57.680
If I hadn't come,

08:57.680 --> 09:00.200
how would I know you've completely lost your mind?

09:00.200 --> 09:03.120
Ji Mingyue is just a stepping stone in our plan.

09:03.520 --> 09:05.560
Instead of figuring out how to take over

09:05.560 --> 09:07.880
all of Baili Jinghong's gold veins,

09:08.760 --> 09:11.220
you actually fell for her at a time like this.

09:11.920 --> 09:13.520
If Helian Jie hadn't told me,

09:13.760 --> 09:15.360
I wouldn't have believed it.

09:15.400 --> 09:17.200
You've only seen her a few times,

09:17.240 --> 09:18.880
and you already like her?

09:22.960 --> 09:24.080
When I was young,

09:25.120 --> 09:26.520
my father doted on me.

09:28.120 --> 09:30.120
He sent the best guards to protect me

09:30.880 --> 09:33.440
and the best painters to make me happy.

09:34.440 --> 09:37.480
But I just couldn't be happy no matter what.

09:38.360 --> 09:39.760
Mother, do you know why?

09:42.080 --> 09:43.840
Because everyone had a mother,

09:44.960 --> 09:45.920
except me.

09:52.800 --> 09:54.040
After Aman was born,

09:55.040 --> 09:56.240
he was sickly.

09:56.560 --> 09:59.240
Father cared for him so much

10:00.240 --> 10:01.480
that he liked me less.

10:04.200 --> 10:05.840
I became even more unhappy.

10:07.000 --> 10:08.880
Countless times, I fantasized

10:08.880 --> 10:09.680
and wondered:

10:11.760 --> 10:12.840
Did my mother

10:14.120 --> 10:15.240
not love me?

10:17.440 --> 10:18.240
Otherwise,

10:19.240 --> 10:20.840
why didn't she come to see me?

10:24.440 --> 10:25.280
Jin.

10:26.000 --> 10:27.040
Later, I found out

10:29.120 --> 10:31.800
that a child took my place

10:32.520 --> 10:34.050
and became Mother's child.

10:35.200 --> 10:36.920
So I sent painters and guards

10:37.320 --> 10:39.050
to secretly record their lives

10:41.280 --> 10:42.280
for me to imagine.

11:02.600 --> 11:04.160
Mother treated her so well.

11:05.360 --> 11:08.040
In summer, you would push her on the swing

11:09.280 --> 11:11.080
and teach her archery yourself.

11:11.560 --> 11:13.020
You would even personally

11:13.120 --> 11:15.250
make her tremella and lotus seed soup.

11:16.800 --> 11:17.960
To this day,

11:18.480 --> 11:19.680
I haven't even tasted

11:20.280 --> 11:21.880
the lotus seed soup you made.

11:26.120 --> 11:27.920
I was really jealous of her then.

11:29.600 --> 11:31.400
My jealousy turned into hatred.

11:31.760 --> 11:32.960
I couldn't accept it.

11:34.520 --> 11:36.560
Why could she take my place

11:36.920 --> 11:37.920
and get your love?

11:39.480 --> 11:41.340
But later she entered the palace,

11:42.200 --> 11:44.240
eliminated enemies for you,

11:46.200 --> 11:48.530
and was labeled a disaster to the country.

11:48.920 --> 11:50.280
She was insulted

11:51.160 --> 11:53.890
and became a demon queen everyone wanted to kill.

11:58.720 --> 12:01.380
Then I started to feel guilty and blamed myself.

12:02.120 --> 12:03.360
Was it

12:04.520 --> 12:05.480
because of me

12:06.400 --> 12:08.560
that a girl had to bear

12:08.560 --> 12:10.960
the responsibilities I should have borne?

12:11.600 --> 12:13.280
Why are you comparing yourself to her?

12:13.280 --> 12:14.480
She's just from the General's manor,

12:14.480 --> 12:16.680
a piece of trash born to a lowly servant.

12:18.840 --> 12:21.360
It was I who taught her consistently for ten years,

12:21.360 --> 12:23.420
so she could have her current skills.

12:23.800 --> 12:25.060
But you're different.

12:25.880 --> 12:27.740
You are extraordinarily gifted.

12:27.880 --> 12:29.610
She can't compare to you at all.

12:30.080 --> 12:31.340
You're wrong, Mother.

12:32.960 --> 12:33.890
She is not trash.

12:36.320 --> 12:38.080
She is the light in my heart.

12:38.680 --> 12:39.640
You are right.

12:41.080 --> 12:43.140
I really haven't seen her many times.

12:44.280 --> 12:45.240
But it feels like

12:46.760 --> 12:48.760
I have loved her for a very long time.

12:50.040 --> 12:51.320
Just like

12:52.400 --> 12:55.000
from the day I started expecting you to love me,

12:56.080 --> 12:57.040
that long.

13:11.920 --> 13:12.720
What is it?

13:13.280 --> 13:14.320
To answer the First Young Master,

13:14.320 --> 13:15.880
I wanted to see if the Empress Dowager

13:15.880 --> 13:17.080
needed any water.

13:18.880 --> 13:19.960
What did you say?

13:20.200 --> 13:21.200
Empress Dowager?

13:21.880 --> 13:22.680
Yes.

13:24.000 --> 13:25.000
You may leave first.

13:25.000 --> 13:25.800
Yes.

13:56.360 --> 13:57.240
Mingyue,

13:58.040 --> 13:58.840
I...

14:36.400 --> 14:38.320
Is this the truth?

14:42.440 --> 14:44.400
So I'm not your child.

14:46.680 --> 14:49.320
I'm just a pawn you raised from childhood.

14:51.400 --> 14:53.960
A piece of trash born to a lowly maid of the General's Manor.

14:53.960 --> 14:55.640
A stepping stone.

15:03.240 --> 15:04.200
Your child

15:06.400 --> 15:07.200
is him.

15:15.400 --> 15:18.840
Young General Jiuying of the Northern Frontier.

15:20.800 --> 15:22.480
Helian Jin of the Helian Clan.

15:34.960 --> 15:36.080
Very well.

15:38.120 --> 15:39.980
Deceiving me over and over again.

15:40.000 --> 15:41.600
You truly are mother and son.

15:45.280 --> 15:46.080
Cut the crap.

15:46.720 --> 15:47.780
Give me the ledger.

15:51.520 --> 15:52.680
Even now,

15:53.080 --> 15:55.120
you're still thinking about the ledger.

15:55.120 --> 15:56.180
Give me the ledger.

15:57.440 --> 15:58.040
Hurry up.

15:58.040 --> 15:59.960
Mother, we can talk about the ledger later.

15:59.960 --> 16:00.760
Let's first...
